WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:05.160
Hey, my name is Sam Street, and I decided
to rent the Eight Sleep instead of

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.640
buy it, um, for a couple of reasons.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.400
Um, number one, it's a very
expensive product to just buy.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.240
Um, I wasn't sure

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.420
how good it would work for me.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.210
Um, I live in Southern California.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:21.040
We have really hot summer months,
and I don't have air conditioning.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.740
And, um, I decided to rent it during the
hottest months of the year to see if

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.860
it made a difference, and it, it has.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.630
Um, but, you know, I didn't want to put
that much money down on a product that

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.220
I wasn't even sure would be right for me,

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.440
um, and it's just a lot of money.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.080
So, that's why I decided to rent it.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.660
Um, I have tested it out
over the past couple months.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.560
I think I'm going on my
third month now with it,

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.920
and I only intended to do a month or two,

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.140
um, but I'm

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.260
continuing to do it because I really
see the benefits for my sleep.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.280
Um, if I were to pitch it to anybody, um,

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.330
you know, I could pitch it
to a lot of people because,

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.580
um, [lip smack] most of my
friends that live in the area,

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:02.360
just air conditioning's not
really a thing in Santa Monica,

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:05.030
and we do have, like, two or
three brutal months of the year.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.530
So, I would, uh, recommend that
they try it out for a month.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:13.070
Um, I got it on sale, uh, I believe it
was a Me- Memorial Day or a 4th of July

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.880
sale, um, and it was half
off for the first month.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.540
So, it made it a really easy decision
for me to at least try it out,

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.780
um, because I could try it
for a month for half off

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:27.210
and, um, really reap
the rewards from that.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.880
[click]
